<div class="panel">
  <div class="topline">
    <h1>🧲 {{ t('Options Magnets', '期权磁吸') }}</h1>
    <span class="muted sm">{{ t('where dealer option-hedging concentrates — the walls, the flip, the pins', '做市商期权对冲集中之处 — 墙、翻转、磁吸点') }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="muted sm note">{{ t(
    "Daily, delayed Cboe levels — NOT live intraday flow. This is a VOL-REGIME + LEVELS MAP (where hedging concentrates), NOT a buy list and NOT directional: gamma tells you the CHARACTER of moves (long-gamma → dealers dampen, price pins/mean-reverts, lower realized vol; short-gamma → dealers amplify, moves trend, higher vol), not which way. The dealer long-call/short-put SIGN is an unobservable assumption — robust enough for indices, FRAGILE for single names (a covered-call ETF or heavy retail call-buying can flip the true sign). Magnet/flip strikes are levels to watch, never targets.",
    "每日、延迟的 Cboe 价位 — 并非实时盘中流动。这是波动率体制 + 价位地图（对冲集中之处），并非买入清单、也无方向性：Gamma 揭示走势的“性质”（多头Gamma → 做市商抑制、价格磁吸/均值回归、已实现波动更低；空头Gamma → 做市商放大、走势趋势化、波动更高），而非方向。做市商“多头看涨/空头看跌”的符号是不可观测的假设 — 对指数稳健，对个股脆弱（卖备兑ETF或散户大量买看涨可翻转真实符号）。磁吸/翻转价位仅供观察，绝非目标价。") }}</p>
</div>

<div class="tabs">
  {% for s in symbols %}<button class="tabbtn {{ 'on' if loop.first }}" data-k="{{ s.key }}">{{ t(s.label, s.zh) }}</button>{% endfor %}
</div>

{% for s in symbols %}
<div class="panel sympanel" id="gx-{{ s.key }}" data-grp="sym"{% if not loop.first %} style="display:none"{% endif %}>
  <div class="hero">
    <span class="regbadge reg-{{ s.regime or 'na' }}">{{ t('Long gamma · pins / mean-revert', '多头Gamma · 磁吸/均值回归') if s.regime=='long' else t('Short gamma · trends / amplifies', '空头Gamma · 趋势/放大') if s.regime=='short' else t('Neutral', '中性') }}
      {{ help('Long gamma (spot above the flip): dealers sell rallies / buy dips → price pins to high-OI strikes, lower realized vol. Short gamma (spot below the flip): dealers chase the move → trends amplify, higher realized vol. Regime, not direction.', '多头Gamma（现价在翻转价之上）：做市商高抛低吸 → 价格磁吸到高未平仓量行权价、波动更低。空头Gamma（现价在翻转价之下）：做市商追涨杀跌 → 趋势放大、波动更高。是体制，非方向。') }}</span>
    <span class="heronum"><span class="muted sm">{{ t('Spot', '现价') }}</span> <b>{{ s.spot }}</b></span>
    <span class="heronum"><span class="muted sm">{{ t('Net GEX', '净GEX') }}</span> <b class="{{ 'pos' if (s.net_gex_bn or 0)>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(s.net_gex_bn) if s.net_gex_bn is not none else '—' }} $bn</b></span>
    <span class="heronum"><span class="muted sm">{{ t('Gamma flip', 'Gamma翻转') }}</span> <b>{{ s.gamma_flip if s.gamma_flip is not none else '—' }}</b> <span class="muted sm">{{ ('(%+.1f%%)'|format(s.dist_to_flip_pct)) if s.dist_to_flip_pct is not none else '' }}</span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="cards">
    {{ card('Magnet ↑', '上磁吸', s.magnet_up if s.magnet_up is not none else '—') }}
    {{ card('Magnet ↓', '下磁吸', s.magnet_down if s.magnet_down is not none else '—') }}
    {{ card('Charm anchor', 'Charm锚', s.charm_anchor if s.charm_anchor is not none else '—') }}
    {{ card('IV30', 'IV30', ('%.1f%%'|format(s.iv30)) if s.iv30 is not none else '—') }}
    {{ card('Put/call OI', '认沽/认购OI', s.put_call_oi_ratio if s.put_call_oi_ratio is not none else '—') }}
    {{ card('Max pain', '最大痛点', s.max_pain if s.max_pain is not none else '—') }}
  </div>

  <div class="lad">
    <div class="muted sm" style="margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Dealer gamma by strike — the walls', '按行权价的做市商Gamma — 墙') }}
      {{ help('Net dealer GEX summed at each strike (±8% of spot). Green = call-heavy (a wall above that resists / pins); red = put-heavy (a wall below). The tallest bars are the magnets; price tends to gravitate toward big positive-gamma strikes under long gamma.', '每个行权价（现价±8%）上做市商净GEX之和。绿=看涨为主（上方的墙，阻力/磁吸）；红=看跌为主（下方的墙）。最长的条即磁吸点；多头Gamma下价格倾向于被大正Gamma行权价吸引。') }}</div>
    {% for r in s.ladder %}
    <div class="lad-row {{ 'mag' if (r.strike == s.magnet_up or r.strike == s.magnet_down) }}">
      <span class="lad-k">{% if r.strike == s.magnet_up or r.strike == s.magnet_down %}<b>{{ '%g'|format(r.strike) }}</b>{% else %}{{ '%g'|format(r.strike) }}{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="lad-bar">{% if r.pct >= 0 %}<i style="left:50%;width:{{ (r.pct/2)|round(1) }}%;background:var(--up)"></i>{% else %}<i style="right:50%;width:{{ (-r.pct/2)|round(1) }}%;background:var(--down)"></i>{% endif %}<i class="mid"></i></span>
      <span class="lad-v {{ 'pos' if r.net_gex_mn>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ r.net_gex_mn }}{% if r.strike == s.magnet_up %}<span class="magtag">{{ t('mag↑','↑') }}</span>{% elif r.strike == s.magnet_down %}<span class="magtag">{{ t('mag↓','↓') }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% if not s.is_index %}
  <p class="muted sm note">{{ t(
    'Single-name caveat: the dealer-sign assumption is fragile here — concentration / covered-call / retail flow can flip it. Top-strike OI share ' ~ (s.top_oi_share if s.top_oi_share is not none else '—') ~ ', chain tier "' ~ s.tier ~ '". Read as loose context, not a level to trade against.',
    '个股提示：此处做市商符号假设脆弱 — 集中度/备兑/散户流可将其翻转。最大行权价OI占比 ' ~ (s.top_oi_share if s.top_oi_share is not none else '—') ~ '，链路等级“' ~ s.tier ~ '”。仅作宽松背景，勿据此逆向交易。') }}</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% endfor %}

<div class="panel">
  <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:0">{{ t(
    'Source: Cboe delayed option chains (free, keyless) → engine/gex_engine.py. Greeks computed dividend-adjusted; the gamma-flip is grid-reevaluated. Daily EOD levels, delayed — NOT live intraday flow (OI updates once per day). A regime + levels map, not predictive alpha. See LIMITATIONS.md.',
    '来源：Cboe 延迟期权链（免费、无需密钥）→ engine/gex_engine.py。希腊字母经股息调整计算；Gamma翻转采用网格重估。每日延迟价位 — 并非实时盘中流动（OI每日更新一次）。体制+价位地图，而非预测性超额收益。') }}
    {{ t('Generated', '生成于') }} {{ built }}</p>
</div>

